        <item>
            <title>Version 1.7.0</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New in 1.7.0</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Improve timesheet specificity and reduce fragmented AI entries</li>
                    <li>Improve timesheet context inference and AI prompt output</li>
                    <li>Improve AI summary with hourly timetable and prompt tuning</li>
                    <li>Add review notes, package lockfile, and n8n workflow export</li>
                    <li>Update archived and exported app build artifacts</li>
                    <li>Expand activity grouping summaries and refresh dashboard breakdown UI</li>
                    <li>Unify task row quick actions across planning, search, and worklog</li>
                    <li>Improve ClickUp task retrieval and harden email forwarding flow</li>
                    <li>Add tracking pause controls and tune context capture intervals</li>
                    <li>Reduce app tracking CPU overhead with caching and throttling</li>                </ul>
            ]]></description>
